AIRPCMND CTLLDGEA FALSE
AIRPCMND INITFUEL 80%
AIRPCMND UNLOADWP
INTENTIO
MINIALTI 50
DOGFIGHT G7.00 B15.00
ENDINTEN

AIRPLANE "MIG-29(RED/MULTIROLE)" FALSE
